1
00:00:00,093 --> 00:00:02,563
(Scene:)Sheldon...

2
00:00:02,562 --> 00:00:05,832
(Amy:)it's okay with me that
you're not perfect.

3
00:00:09,903 --> 00:00:13,403
(Sheldon:)Can I have one more moment
with Leonard?

4
00:00:13,406 --> 00:00:15,476
(Howard:)Sure.

5
00:00:22,716 --> 00:00:26,046
(Sheldon:)Amy just hurt my feelings.
I want to break up with her.

6
00:00:28,955 --> 00:00:31,655
(Howard:)Now, I never thought
I'd say this, but I'm

7
00:00:31,658 --> 00:00:34,998
(Howard:)kind of excited to see Sheldon.

8
00:00:34,995 --> 00:00:38,025
(Howard:)I never thought I'd say this,
but Penny got a job today.

9
00:00:38,999 --> 00:00:40,399
(Howard:)She did?

10
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:42,030
(Bernadette:)Well, the only reason she got it

11
00:00:42,035 --> 00:00:44,865
(Bernadette:)is 'cause the guy
who interviewed her loves me.

12
00:00:44,871 --> 00:00:46,501
(knocking)

13
00:00:47,574 --> 00:00:49,644
(clears throat)

14
00:00:50,744 --> 00:00:52,914
(Howard(answering a knock on the door):)What do you want?

15
00:00:52,913 --> 00:00:55,813
(Stuart:)I, uh, kind of got the feeling

16
00:00:55,815 --> 00:00:58,755
(Stuart:)you might not be okay with me
staying at your mom's.

17
00:00:58,752 --> 00:01:00,022
(Howard:)You're right, I'm not.

